      "html": "<div class=\"wsite-section-content\">\n          <div class=\"container\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wsite-section-elements\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"paragraph\"><font color=\"#2a2a2a\">Love and Devi is based in the Amazon Jungle and sis working alongside different indigenous medicine people to bring a truly authentic experience for those feeling called.&nbsp;<br>Fly to Iquitos, Peru and connect back to Mother Earth as we venture into the Amazon. Depending of the activities you wish to partake in while here in the jungle will determine the location of the Amazon we will travel to.&nbsp;<br><br>We offer personalized retreats, please contact us for more information:&nbsp;<a href=\"mailto:loveanddevi@gmail.com\">loveanddevi@gmail.com</a><br><br>We offer group retreats that families.. friends.. fellow journeyers may join. Please see above for retreats we are currently booking. Contact&nbsp;us for more information:&nbsp;</font><a href=\"mailto:loveanddevi@gmail.com\">loveanddevi@gmail.com</a></div>\n\n<div><div class=\"wsite-multicol\"><div class=\"wsite-multicol-table-wrap\" style=\"margin:0 -15px;\">\n\t<table class=\"wsite-multicol-table\">\n\t\t<tbody class=\"wsite-multicol-tbody\">\n\t\t\t<tr class=\"wsite-multicol-tr\">\n\t\t\t\t<td class=\"wsite-multicol-col\" style=\"width:49.999999999999%; padding:0 15px;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n<div class=\"wsite-spacer\" style=\"height:50px;\"></div>\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</td>\t\t\t\t<td class=\"wsite-multicol-col\" style=\"width:49.999999999999%; padding:0 15px;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n<div class=\"wsite-spacer\" style=\"height:50px;\"></div>\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</td>\t\t\t</tr>\n\t\t</tbody>\n\t</table>\n</div></div></div>\n\n<span class='imgPusher' style='float:right;height:0px'></span><span style='display: table;width:auto;position:relative;float:right;max-width:100%;;clear:right;margin-top:0px;*margin-top:0px'><a><img src=\"uploads/1/1/2/9/112908841/img-5836.jpg?250\" style=\"margin-top: 10px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 10px; border-width:0; max-width:100%\" alt=\"Picture\" class=\"galleryImageBorder wsite-image\"></a><span style=\"display: table-caption; caption-side: bottom; font-size: 90%; margin-top: -10px; margin-bottom: 10px; text-align: center;\" class=\"wsite-caption\"></span></span>\n<div class=\"paragraph\" style=\"display:block;\"><font size=\"3\" color=\"#2a2a2a\">The retreats can encompass many&nbsp;activities, such as:</font><ul style=\"color:rgb(51, 51, 51)\"><li><font size=\"3\">Jungle exploration</font></li><li><font size=\"3\">Observation and swimming with pink and grey dolphins</font></li><li><font size=\"3\">Observation of 13 species of monkeys in their natural state</font></li><li><font size=\"3\">Participation in medicinal plant ceremonies with native shipibo shamans</font></li><li><font size=\"3\">Hiking in primary jungle (low and high jungle)</font></li><li><font size=\"3\">Explanation of medicinal plants</font></li><li><font size=\"3\">Observation of sloths in their natural state (perezosos)</font></li><li><font size=\"3\">Night jungle walk to search for tarantulas, snakes, scorpions, frogs, toads, jaguars, insects and much more</font></li><li><font size=\"3\">Observation of giant lily pads (water lily Victoria Regia)</font></li><li><font size=\"3\">Camping or lodge accommodation (flexible)</font></li><li><font size=\"3\">Visits to native villages / local communities</font></li><li><font size=\"3\">Search for kambo frog to excrete medicine</font></li><li><font size=\"3\">Working one on one with indigneous medicine people</font><br></li><li><font size=\"3\">And much more...</font></li></ul><br><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"color:rgb(21, 30, 36)\">All the activities are flexible according to your personal interests.</span><br><br><span style=\"color:rgb(21, 30, 36)\">All food is included in the price as well as transportation to and from the lodge (located in the jungle) and Iquitos, Peru.&nbsp;</span><br><span style=\"color:rgb(21, 30, 36)\">(**Flights to Peru and accommodation in Iquitos are not included.)</span><br><br></font></div>\n<hr style=\"width:100%;clear:both;visibility:hidden;\">\n\n<div><div class=\"wsite-multicol\"><div class=\"wsite-multicol-table-wrap\" style=\"margin:0 -15px;\">\n\t<table class=\"wsite-multicol-table\">\n\t\t<tbody class=\"wsite-multicol-tbody\">\n\t\t\t<tr class=\"wsite-multicol-tr\">\n\t\t\t\t<td class=\"wsite-multicol-col\" style=\"width:33.333333333333%; padding:0 15px;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n<div class=\"paragraph\" style=\"text-align:right;\"><font color=\"#2a2a2a\">Click here:</font></div>\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</td>\t\t\t\t<td class=\"wsite-multicol-col\" style=\"width:33.333333333333%; padding:0 15px;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n<div style=\"text-align:left;\"><div style=\"height: 10px; overflow: hidden;\"></div>\n<a class=\"wsite-button wsite-button-small wsite-button-highlight\" href=\"https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g294315-d10842997-Reviews-Kambo_Jungle_Expeditions-Iquitos_Loreto_Region.html\" target=\"_blank\">\n<span class=\"wsite-button-inner\">Guest Reviews</span>\n</a>\n<div style=\"height: 10px; overflow: hidden;\"></div></div>\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</td>\t\t\t\t<td class=\"wsite-multicol-col\" style=\"width:33.333333333333%; padding:0 15px;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n<div class=\"wsite-spacer\" style=\"height:50px;\"></div>\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</td>\t\t\t</tr>\n\t\t</tbody>\n\t</table>\n</div></div></div>\n\n<div class=\"wsite-youtube\" style=\"margin-bottom:10px;margin-top:10px;\"><div class=\"wsite-youtube-wrapper wsite-youtube-size-medium wsite-youtube-align-center\">\n<div class=\"wsite-youtube-container\">\n\n<iframe src=\"//www.youtube.com/embed/eW7Nl9wiBUI?wmode=opaque\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"paragraph\" style=\"text-align:left;\"><br><font size=\"3\"><font color=\"#151e24\">&#8203;</font></font>